# when we have a number of services, say 100, then we can't expect to have 100 load balancers.
# We use ingress to solve this problem. Ingress helps us by exposing all the nodes with their cluster-IPs. Ingress has a DNS. And it will route the traffic to the services in the cluster using the cluster IP.

# With Ingress we use one load balancer for many apps:
Internet → Load Balancer → Ingress Controller → Service A (/api)
                                              → Service B (/shop)
                                              → Service C (grafana.example.com)

# Ingress controllers helps us to perform host based and path based routing

